<p><strong>&Pi;&omicron;&lambda;&lambda;&alpha;&pi;&lambda;&omicron;ί &Lambda;&omicron;&gamma;&alpha;&rho;&iota;&alpha;&sigma;&mu;&omicron;ί. </strong>&Epsilon;ά&nu; έ&chi;&epsilon;&tau;&epsilon; &pi;&omicron;&lambda;&lambda;&alpha;&pi;&lambda;&omicron;ύ&sigmaf; &Lambda;&omicron;&gamma;&alpha;&rho;&iota;&alpha;&sigma;&mu;&omicron;ύ&sigmaf; Google &mu;&epsilon; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&phi;&omicron;&rho;&epsilon;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ά &omicron;&nu;ό&mu;&alpha;&tau;&alpha; &chi;&rho;ή&sigma;&tau;&eta;, &sigma;&epsilon; &omicron;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&mu;έ&nu;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&pi;&tau;ώ&sigma;&epsilon;&iota;&sigmaf; &mu;&pi;&omicron;&rho;&epsilon;ί &nu;&alpha; &mu;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&phi;έ&rho;&epsilon;&tau;&epsilon; &Pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&epsilon;&chi;ό&mu;&epsilon;&nu;&omicron; &alpha;&pi;ό έ&nu;&alpha;&nu; &lambda;&omicron;&gamma;&alpha;&rho;&iota;&alpha;&sigma;&mu;ό &sigma;&epsilon; &kappa;ά&pi;&omicron;&iota;&omicron;&nu; ά&lambda;&lambda;&omicron;, &epsilon;&phi;ό&sigma;&omicron;&nu; &epsilon;ί&sigma;&tau;&epsilon; &omicron; &kappa;ά&tau;&omicron;&chi;&omicron;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &tau;&omega;&nu; &delta;ύ&omicron; &lambda;&omicron;&gamma;&alpha;&rho;&iota;&alpha;&sigma;&mu;ώ&nu; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &eta; Google έ&chi;&epsilon;&iota; &epsilon;&nu;&epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&omicron;&pi;&omicron;&iota;ή&sigma;&epsilon;&iota; &mu;&iota;&alpha; &lambda;&epsilon;&iota;&tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&rho;&gamma;ί&alpha; &tau;&eta;&sigmaf; &sigma;&chi;&epsilon;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή&sigmaf; &upsilon;&pi;&eta;&rho;&epsilon;&sigma;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &pi;&omicron;&upsilon; &epsilon;&pi;&iota;&tau;&rho;έ&pi;&epsilon;&iota; &alpha;&upsilon;&tau;έ&sigmaf; &tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &mu;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&phi;&omicron;&rho;έ&sigmaf;.</p>
<p><strong>&Pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&omicron;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&mu;&omicron;ί &pi;&rho;ό&sigma;&beta;&alpha;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &sigma;&epsilon; &Sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&kappa;&epsilon;&upsilon;έ&sigmaf;.</strong> &Eta; Google &mu;&pi;&omicron;&rho;&epsilon;ί &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&alpha;&sigma;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;ά &nu;&alpha; &theta;έ&tau;&epsilon;&iota; ό&rho;&iota;&alpha; &sigma;&tau;&omicron;&nu; &alpha;&rho;&iota;&theta;&mu;ό &tau;&omega;&nu; &Sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&kappa;&epsilon;&upsilon;ώ&nu; ή &tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&phi;&alpha;&rho;&mu;&omicron;&gamma;ώ&nu; &lambda;&omicron;&gamma;&iota;&sigma;&mu;&iota;&kappa;&omicron;ύ &pi;&omicron;&upsilon; &mu;&pi;&omicron;&rho;&epsilon;ί&tau;&epsilon; &nu;&alpha; &chi;&rho;&eta;&sigma;&iota;&mu;&omicron;&pi;&omicron;&iota;&epsilon;ί&tau;&epsilon; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &tau;&eta;&nu; &pi;&rho;ό&sigma;&beta;&alpha;&sigma;&eta; &sigma;&tau;&omicron; &Pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&epsilon;&chi;ό&mu;&epsilon;&nu;&omicron;. &Alpha;&nu;&alpha;&tau;&rho;έ&xi;&tau;&epsilon; &sigma;&tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; <a href="https://play.google.com/about/movies-tv-usage-rules.html">&Kappa;&alpha;&nu;ό&nu;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &chi;&rho;ή&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &Tau;&alpha;&iota;&nu;&iota;ώ&nu; &amp; TV Google Play / Google TV</a> &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&sigma;ό&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &pi;&lambda;&eta;&rho;&omicron;&phi;&omicron;&rho;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &sigma;&chi;&epsilon;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ά &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&alpha; &epsilon;&nu; &lambda;ό&gamma;&omega; ό&rho;&iota;&alpha; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &Tau;&alpha;&iota;&nu;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &amp; TV Google Play / &tau;&omicron; Google TV.</p>
<p><strong>&Epsilon;&pi;&iota;&kappa;ί&nu;&delta;&upsilon;&nu;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &Delta;&rho;&alpha;&sigma;&tau;&eta;&rho;&iota;ό&tau;&eta;&tau;&epsilon;&sigmaf;. </strong>&Kappa;&alpha;&mu;ί&alpha; &alpha;&pi;ό &tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &Upsilon;&pi;&eta;&rho;&epsilon;&sigma;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; ή &tau;&omicron; &Pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&epsilon;&chi;ό&mu;&epsilon;&nu;&omicron; &delta;&epsilon;&nu; &pi;&rho;&omicron;&omicron;&rho;ί&zeta;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&iota; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &chi;&rho;ή&sigma;&eta; &sigma;&tau;&eta; &lambda;&epsilon;&iota;&tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&rho;&gamma;ί&alpha; &pi;&upsilon;&rho;&eta;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ώ&nu; &epsilon;&gamma;&kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&sigma;&tau;ά&sigma;&epsilon;&omega;&nu;, &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&tau;&eta;&mu;ά&tau;&omega;&nu; &upsilon;&pi;&omicron;&sigma;&tau;ή&rho;&iota;&xi;&eta;&sigmaf; &zeta;&omega;ή&sigmaf;, &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&tau;&eta;&mu;ά&tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&pi;&iota;&kappa;&omicron;&iota;&nu;&omega;&nu;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; έ&kappa;&tau;&alpha;&kappa;&tau;&eta;&sigmaf; &alpha;&nu;ά&gamma;&kappa;&eta;&sigmaf;, &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&tau;&eta;&mu;ά&tau;&omega;&nu; &pi;&lambda;&omicron;ή&gamma;&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; ή &epsilon;&pi;&iota;&kappa;&omicron;&iota;&nu;&omega;&nu;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &alpha;&epsilon;&rho;&omicron;&sigma;&kappa;&alpha;&phi;ώ&nu;, &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&tau;&eta;&mu;ά&tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&lambda;έ&gamma;&chi;&omicron;&upsilon; &epsilon;&nu;&alpha;έ&rho;&iota;&alpha;&sigmaf; &kappa;&upsilon;&kappa;&lambda;&omicron;&phi;&omicron;&rho;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; ή ά&lambda;&lambda;&omega;&nu; &pi;&alpha;&rho;ό&mu;&omicron;&iota;&omega;&nu; &delta;&rho;&alpha;&sigma;&tau;&eta;&rho;&iota;&omicron;&tau;ή&tau;&omega;&nu; &sigma;&tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &omicron;&pi;&omicron;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &tau;&upsilon;&chi;ό&nu; &alpha;&pi;&omicron;&tau;&upsilon;&chi;ί&alpha; &tau;&omega;&nu; &Upsilon;&pi;&eta;&rho;&epsilon;&sigma;&iota;ώ&nu; ή &tau;&omicron;&upsilon; &Pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&epsilon;&chi;&omicron;&mu;έ&nu;&omicron;&upsilon; &theta;&alpha; &mu;&pi;&omicron;&rho;&omicron;ύ&sigma;&epsilon; &nu;&alpha; &pi;&rho;&omicron;&kappa;&alpha;&lambda;έ&sigma;&epsilon;&iota; &theta;ά&nu;&alpha;&tau;&omicron;, &tau;&rho;&alpha;&upsilon;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&sigma;&mu;ό ή &sigma;&omicron;&beta;&alpha;&rho;έ&sigmaf; &upsilon;&lambda;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; ή &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&beta;&alpha;&lambda;&lambda;&omicron;&nu;&tau;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &zeta;&eta;&mu;&iota;έ&sigmaf;.</p>
<p><strong>&Tau;&alpha;&iota;&nu;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &amp; TV Google Play / Google TV.</strong> &Gamma;&iota;&alpha; &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&sigma;ό&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &lambda;&epsilon;&pi;&tau;&omicron;&mu;έ&rho;&epsilon;&iota;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &pi;&lambda;&eta;&rho;&omicron;&phi;&omicron;&rho;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &sigma;&chi;&epsilon;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ά &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&omicron;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&mu;&omicron;ύ&sigmaf; &pi;&rho;ό&sigma;&beta;&alpha;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &chi;&rho;ή&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &pi;&omicron;&upsilon; &iota;&sigma;&chi;ύ&omicron;&upsilon;&nu; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &Tau;&alpha;&iota;&nu;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &amp; TV Google Play &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &tau;&omicron; Google TV, &alpha;&nu;&alpha;&tau;&rho;έ&xi;&tau;&epsilon; &sigma;&tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; <a href="https://play.google.com/about/movies-tv-usage-rules.html">&Kappa;&alpha;&nu;ό&nu;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &chi;&rho;ή&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &Tau;&alpha;&iota;&nu;&iota;ώ&nu; &amp; TV Google Play / Google TV. </a></p>
      
      
